WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.251
1. Go to People and click Add person.

2
00:00:02.251 --> 00:00:04.337
2. Type their Windows logon; the domain is filled in for you.

3
00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:09.200
3. Add their name and work email. Reminders and approvals go there.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:15.947
4. Tick what they can do, then click Add person. They're emailed a welcome.
